      "published_at": "2026-11-24T02:36:42Z",
      "title": "Jaden McDaniels with 28-6-5 on 10-for-12 shooting, bringing his season average to just over 18 PPG, I'm just saying sports.yahoo.com/nba/article/...",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/yourmandevine.bsky.social/post/3n2zmeefaok2h",
      "author": "Dan Devine",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:4xpj3xjxsxxcuh3ghaulzdqu/bafkreidh4bovlxsrhgimo6fr4zbjajffib5bzeae3lnhlvhxdv7s2cinmq",
      "body_excerpt": "Jaden McDaniels with 28-6-5 on 10-for-12 shooting, bringing his season average to just over 18 PPG, I'm just saying sports.yahoo.com/nba/article/...",
      "players": [
        "jaden-mcdaniels"
